# A user places an order. The API checks stock in Redis (miss), then queries MySQL and charges the
# payment service at the same time. Stock is found, but the payment times out, so the API returns 502.
title Order request
speed 1.2

user[User] -> api[API Server] : POST /order
api -> cache[Redis] : check stock
cache --> api : miss
api -> db[MySQL] : SELECT stock & api -> pay[Payment] : charge
db --> api : in stock
pay -x api : timeout
api --> user : 502 retry later
